How to attribute
----------------

Something along these lines is plenty:

  Adapted from c3check (https://c3check.com), CC BY 4.0.

If you adapt the writing in a way that changes its meaning (particularly if you
change how a statutory reading is described, or drop a stated uncertainty),
please say so alongside the credit. The licence requires you to indicate
modifications; here it matters more than usual, because a confident-sounding
paraphrase of a genuinely unsettled point is the specific failure this project
is built to avoid.
